<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kouff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebrüchend</unclear>, und hannd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> für bringen und an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zoegen</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>, wie sy (und ander mer) uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schinen</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sampstag</unclear></date>. In
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euwer</unclear> statt uff offnem marckt. Ir garn, wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alter</unclear>
