<lb n="10"/>der <orgName resp="#ner">weber zunfft</orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> befelchs man. zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> komen. und
<lb n="11"/>ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iedem</unclear>. an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fünff</unclear> schilig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pfening</unclear> uff der weber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huß</unclear> für die
<lb n="12"/>zunfft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bottenn</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">da</unclear> hin komen. hab <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> der
