<lb n="33"/>zuo meren und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gepflantzen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nüt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">under</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lassen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdind</unclear>.
<lb n="34"/>Und wir aber der selbigen satzung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nüt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruntlichen</unclear> bricht,
